// Query/key epilogue with peer-row normalization and final output publication.
// The role retains local and peer storage until its arrival/departure
// barriers retire each phase. Native helpers preserve BFP/F32 arithmetic,
// sequence isolation, and explicit FIFO/lock ownership across token panels.
